        </span>
        <span class="p-4 md:p-0 mt-4 mb-4">
          <!-- <p class="tracking-[0.3em] max-w-[450px] w-full text-lg text-white mb-1">
            I'm a web developer with five years of experience in the industry.
          </p> -->
          <p class="tracking-[0.3em] max-w-[450px] w-full text-lg text-white">
            My expertise lies in web development, where I have had the opportunity to work on many projects and achieved an excellent.
          </p>
        </span>
         <!-- To work on these to accept clicks -->
        <div class="">
          <div class="mt-4 flex items-center justify-between gap-3 space-x-2">
            <a href="https://github.com/EdiCeM24" class="border border-pink-500 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center object-cover w-6 h-6"><i class="fa-brands fa-github text-white flex items-center justify-center object-cover"></i></a>
            <a href="https://facebook.com/Saviour Marcus" class="border border-pink-500 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center object-cover w-6 h-6"><i class="fa-brands fa-facebook text-white flex items-center justify-center object-cover"></i></a>
            <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/cletus-marcus" class="border border-pink-500 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center object-cover w-6 h-6"><i class="fa-brands fa-linkedin text-white flex items-center justify-center object-cover"></i></a>
            <a href="https://x.com/Edicem24" class="border border-pink-500 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center object-cover w-6 h-6"><i class="fa-brands fa-twitter text-white flex items-center justify-center object-cover"></i></a>
            <a href="https://ma" class="border border-pink-500 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center object-cover w-6 h-6"><i class="fa-brands fa-youtube text-white flex items-center justify-center object-cover"></i></a>
          </div>

          <div class="flex items-center justify-evenly md:gap-3 gap-5  mb-3 lg:mt-3.5 mt-5 p-4 px-6">
            <!-- Some Mobile Devices are not clicked and hovered -->
            <button class="hover:bg-white focus:bg-white hover:opacity-60 border-2 border-purple-700 whitespace-nowrap text-white hover:text-slate-950 transition-transform duration-200 ease-in-out shadow-md grass py-5 px-5 rounded-sm text-[16px] font-extrabold cursor-pointer gap-1.5" id="openPopup-btn">
              Hire Me <i class="fa-solid fa-angle-right hover:text-slate-950"></i>
